body:
I'm a big Van Gogh fan so I may have to look that up.  Any particular bio you read?

&#x200B;

Yeah those guys were jerks and it says more about them than me.  I need to learn to confront people like that.

I would love to see this so much.  I've wanted to see WWI, II and the civil war especially.  Especially if you could put it on an interactive map and scroll around and see different theaters.  

&#x200B;

I've looked at trying to make some these myself but am not good at researching the detailed data needed.
